description:
Several hundred photos of spring clouds captured and rendered as this 4K timelapse video. There is no music, so you may use it as a relaxing screensaver.
Took these photos in my mirrorless Fujifilm camera with my family's old Minolta lens through adapter for a more classic look.

Feel free to visit my Etsy Page to get yourself a Digital Print for Decoration printing or digital wallpaper with 10% off:
https://www.etsy.com/shop/LuxDaletPhotography?coupon=LUXATYOUTUBE

Used:
@fujifilmxseries4081  's X-T4 for photos
Minolta Maxxum AF 50mm f/1.7 Adapted lens through @FotodioxInc 's AF-FX
@Apple  's Quicktime for video rendering from photos
@BlackmagicDesignOfficial  Davinci Resolve 18 for video editing
